flowchart TD
 A[Candidate code] --> B[Compile / static checks]
 B --> C{Functional tests pass?}
 C -->|No| X[Reject / diagnose]
 C -->|Yes| D[Compare FP errors and scientific invariants]
 D --> E{Within task-specific tolerances?}
 E -->|No| X
 E -->|Yes| F[Warmup + repeated benchmarking]
 F --> G{Faster on representative cases?}
 G -->|No| X
 G -->|Yes| H[Independent review + canary]
 H --> I[Monitor drift and rollback]
